<br/><a name="ha"/><h1>High Availability</h1>

<p>In a high availability environment, SQL Relay can be deployed as a front-end to provide load balancing and failover for a set of replicated database servers or database cluster.  Load balancing and failover can also be implemented over multiple SQL Relay servers.</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="hacluster.html">Load Balancing and Failover With Replicated Databases or Database Clusters</a></li>
  <li><a href="harac.html">Already-Load Balanced Databases</a></li>
  <li><a href="hamasterslave.html">Master-Slave Query Routing</a></li>
  <li><a href="hafrontendlb.html">Front-End Load Balancing and Failover</a></li>
</ul>

